WEBVTT

00:03:27.716 --> 00:03:31.796
Maybe for a lost love
that never existed in the first place,

00:03:31.836 --> 00:03:33.436
but the curious thing is,

00:03:33.436 --> 00:03:35.436
when I hear music like this,

00:03:35.436 --> 00:03:38.556
I don't really feel sad or not very sad.

00:03:38.596 --> 00:03:43.156
What I actually feel
is something that's much closer to joy.

00:03:43.156 --> 00:03:46.356
And I could never understand why this was.

00:03:46.356 --> 00:03:49.276
But meanwhile, I noticed
that my law school classmates

00:03:49.276 --> 00:03:51.556
were feeling very little joy.

00:03:51.596 --> 00:03:54.516
One of them asked me
why I was listening to funeral music.

00:03:54.556 --> 00:03:55.716
(Laughter)

00:03:55.756 --> 00:03:58.516
And I laughed, and we went off to class.

00:03:58.556 --> 00:03:59.876
End of story.